1p1y|a|Of or pertaining to one of the poles of the earth, or of a sphere; situated near, or proceeding from, one of the poles; as, polar regions; polar seas; polar winds. ; Of or pertaining to the magnetic pole, or to the point to which the magnetic needle is directed. ; Pertaining to, reckoned from, or having a common radiating point; as, polar coordinates.	j:gyr,114,10;7a8,95,5;1iyg,92,8;vir,55,3~gyr,114,10;1iyg,92,8;7a8,95,5;vir,55,3
